{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014UGHpg22P3fY1n5oxSXpn3","type":"tool_result","content":"657\t  }\n658\t}\n659\t\n660\t/* ============================================================\n661\t   Native Popover + CSS Anchor Positioning (US-144)\n662\t   Uses HTML popover attribute for keyboard/focus management\n663\t   and CSS anchor-name / position-anchor for tethering.\n664\t   @supports fallback for browsers without anchor positioning.\n665\t   Chrome 125+, Edge 125+. Safari/Firefox: absolute fallback.\n666\t   ============================================================ */\n667\t.info-popover-anchor {\n668\t  position: relative;\n669\t  display: inline-flex;\n670\t}\n671\t\n672\t.info-popover-trigger {\n673\t  all: unset;\n674\t  display: inline-flex;\n675\t  cursor: pointer;\n676\t}\n677\t\n678\t.info-popover {\n679\t  margin: 0;\n680\t  border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-200, #e7e5e4);\n681\t  border-radius: 0.75rem;\n682\t  padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n683\t  background: white;\n684\t  color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n685\t  font-size: 0.8125rem;\n686\t  line-height: 1.4;\n687\t  max-width: 15rem;\n688\t  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);\n689\t  /* Entry animation */\n690\t  opacity: 1;\n691\t  transition: opacity 0.15s ease-out, transform 0.15s ease-out;\n692\t}\n693\t\n694\t.info-popover:not(:popover-open) {\n695\t  display: none;\n696\t}\n697\t\n698\t/* Anchor positioning (Chrome 125+) */\n699\t@supports (position-anchor: --x) {\n700\t  .info-popover {\n701\t    position: fixed;\n702\t    position-area: block-end span-inline-end;\n703\t    margin-top: 0.375rem;\n704\t  }\n705\t}\n706\t\n707\t/* Fallback for browsers without anchor positioning */\n708\t@supports not (position-anchor: --x) {\n709\t  .info-popover {\n710\t    position: absolute;\n711\t    top: calc(100% + 0.375rem);\n712\t    left: 50%;\n713\t    transform: translateX(-50%);\n714\t  }\n715\t}\n716\t\n717\t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n718\t  .info-popover {\n719\t    background: var(--color-stone-800, #292524);\n720\t    color: var(--color-stone-200, #e7e5e4);\n721\t    border-color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n722\t    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3);\n723\t  }\n724\t}\n725\t\n726\t/* Forced colors: ensure popover border is visible */\n727\t@media (forced-colors: active) {\n728\t  .info-popover {\n729\t    border: 2px solid CanvasText;\n730\t  }\n731\t}\n732\t\n733\t/* Custom scrollbar */\n734\t::-webkit-scrollbar {\n735\t  width: 8px;\n736\t}\n737\t\n738\t::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n739\t  @apply bg-stone-100;\n740\t}\n741\t\n742\t::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n743\t  @apply bg-stone-300 rounded-full;\n744\t}\n745\t\n746\t::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n747\t  @apply bg-stone-400;\n748\t}\n749\t\n750\t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n751\t  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n752\t    background-color: #1c1917;\n753\t  }\n754\t  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n755\t    background-color: #57534e;\n756\t  }\n757\t  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n758\t    background-color: #78716c;\n759\t  }\n760\t}\n761\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6a2d14e-7283-489b-bbc5-9e98631480bf","uuid":"715f6e07-58c7-445b-86b2-854db174fd9d","timestamp":"2026-04-14T00:17:29.694Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/c/Users/Jyue/Documents/1-projects/Software Projects/pelangi-website/site/src/app/globals.css","content":"  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Native Popover + CSS Anchor Positioning (US-144)\n   Uses HTML popover attribute for keyboard/focus management\n   and CSS anchor-name / position-anchor for tethering.\n   @supports fallback for browsers without anchor positioning.\n   Chrome 125+, Edge 125+. Safari/Firefox: absolute fallback.\n   ============================================================ */\n.info-popover-anchor {\n  position: relative;\n  display: inline-flex;\n}\n\n.info-popover-trigger {\n  all: unset;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.info-popover {\n  margin: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-200, #e7e5e4);\n  border-radius: 0.75rem;\n  padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n  background: white;\n  color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n  font-size: 0.8125rem;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  max-width: 15rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);\n  /* Entry animation */\n  opacity: 1;\n  transition: opacity 0.15s ease-out, transform 0.15s ease-out;\n}\n\n.info-popover:not(:popover-open) {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* Anchor positioning (Chrome 125+) */\n@supports (position-anchor: --x) {\n  .info-popover {\n    position: fixed;\n    position-area: block-end span-inline-end;\n    margin-top: 0.375rem;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fallback for browsers without anchor positioning */\n@supports not (position-anchor: --x) {\n  .info-popover {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: calc(100% + 0.375rem);\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .info-popover {\n    background: var(--color-stone-800, #292524);\n    color: var(--color-stone-200, #e7e5e4);\n    border-color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Forced colors: ensure popover border is visible */\n@media (forced-colors: active) {\n  .info-popover {\n    border: 2px solid CanvasText;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Custom scrollbar */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  @apply bg-stone-100;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  @apply bg-stone-300 rounded-full;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  @apply bg-stone-400;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n    background-color: #1c1917;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n    background-color: #57534e;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n    background-color: #78716c;\n  }\n}\n","numLines":105,"startLine":657,"totalLines":761}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017RdvUsuRYsBPTEZ4b9sp3a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the CSS changes from the previous attempt are already in place and look good. The globals.css was moved — the custom scrollbar CSS was originally at the end of the file, and now the popover CSS was inserted before it.\n\nLet me now check what the full diff of `Header.tsx` and `HeroTrustBadges.tsx` looks like.\n\nNow let me assess what needs to happen:\n\n1. The previous attempt's changes are in the working tree (not committed)\n\n\n2. The InfoPopover component is already set up with the necessary CSS in globals.css\n3. Both HeroTrustBadges and Header are already using InfoPopover\n4. The Tooltip component I just created doesn't match what's actually needed\n\nThe diff was bloated at 17788 lines because the previous attempt staged everything including .spiral/ files and package-lock.json. The actual site/ changes are only around 185 lines. I need to clean up the Tooltip component since it's not required, then verify the remaining changes are correct.\n\nBefore committing, I should check if InfoPopover still has those `@ts-expect-error` comments—React 19 should handle the popover attributes natively, so I can remove them. Looking at what's already been done, the acceptance criteria are essentially met: the InfoPopover component exists, it's applied to both HeroTrustBadges and Header, and the CSS positioning is in place. I just need to verify the build works and commit only the site/ files without the bloated dependencies.\n\nBut there's a potential issue with how the Header's search button is wrapped—wrapping it in InfoPopover would make the button toggle a popover AND trigger the search action simultaneously, which could cause unexpected behavior. Let me examine the current Header implementation to see if this conflict actually exists.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,